    <briefdescription>
<para>Current replication lag for a single replica. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lag is measured as the time elapsed since the latest committed transaction on the leader minus the time it was applied on the replica (or an approximation thereof based on sequence numbers and wall-clock time). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
